    "display_name": "Animal Adoption",
    "long_instructions": "## Examine the Display\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Run the app and look at the animals displayed.\r\n2. Compare the animals shown to the full `animals` array in the code.\r\n3. Look for patterns in what is shown.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Reflect:\r\n\r\n- What animals are shown in the app?\r\n- Does the app show all animals in the dataset?\r\n- How is what you see different from the full dataset?\r\n- What might a user assume based on what is shown?",
